# VITE_GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID: Optional public Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID
# (*.apps.googleusercontent.com) for client-side Google Drive sync (SYNC_TabScore).
# This is NOT an API key and has NO client secret: access is restricted by Google
# to the Authorized JavaScript Origins configured in Google Cloud Console.
# On GitHub Pages, set this as a Repository Variable (Actions -> Variables).
VITE_GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=""
